== Section A — The Scope of Commerce and the Units of Business (Questions 1–6)

#mcq(1, [Commerce is best defined as],
  [trade and the aids to trade],
  [the production of goods and services],
  [the work of government departments],
  [the buying and selling of shares]
)

#mcq(2, [Which activity belongs to industry rather than commerce?],
  [quarrying limestone],
  [insuring a shipment],
  [advertising a new product],
  [selling goods in a shop]
)

#mcq(3, [Utility created by transporting goods from Kano to Lagos is],
  [possession utility],
  [time utility],
  [form utility],
  [place utility]
)

#mcq(4, [A partnership with no deed of partnership will share profit],
  [in the ratio of age],
  [in the ratio of capital contributed],
  [equally],
  [in the ratio of time devoted]
)

#mcq(5, [The liability of a sole trader is],
  [limited to his capital],
  [shared with his customers],
  [unlimited],
  [limited to his stock]
)

#mcq(6, [A cooperative society distributes surplus to members according to],
  [the value of their patronage],
  [the size of their families],
  [their age in the society],
  [the number of shares held]
)

